1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,747
This is the second law as an inequality.

2
00:00:02,747 --> 00:00:08,958
In any process, the total entropy of the system and its surroundings never decreases.

3
00:00:08,958 --> 00:00:12,395
It stays the same only for a reversible process.

4
00:00:12,395 --> 00:00:17,239
Every real process increases the entropy of the universe.

